#: ../../content/applications/hr/employees.rst:135
msgid ":menuselection:`Employees app --> Employees --> Org Chart` shows the reporting lines: each employee with their manager above them and their direct reports below. The same chart appears in the :guilabel:`Work Information` tab of an employee form, where it can be navigated by clicking a name."
