#: ../../content/applications/hr/employees/badges.rst:43
msgid "To add a badge in the **Employees** app, first navigate to :menuselection:`Employees app --> Configuration --> Challenges --> Badges`, then click the :guilabel:`New` button in the upper-left corner."
