msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/performance/reporting.rst:107
msgid "The two filters that earn their keep are :guilabel:`Late` — past its deadline and still planned or in progress — and :guilabel:`Carried Over`, which shows the actions that were agreed in an earlier review and are still not done. A list of actions carried over twice is the most honest measure of whether your review process changes anything."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/hr/performance/reporting.rst:112
msgid "Group by :guilabel:`Type` to see what your company actually commits to: if every plan in the company is *Training*, either you have solved coaching and stretch assignments or nobody is offering them."
msgstr ""

